{"v":2,"desc":"The Enigma Machine是一款能讓人體驗經典遊戲不可預測的複雜性和挑動不安情緒的效果編排，採用第一人稱視角的科幻恐怖冒險遊戲。透過融合了老式CLI命令式介面畫面、與90年代中期的3D圖形、以及VHS風格效果的第一人稱視角畫面，提供給玩家奇特而難忘的遊戲體驗。\n您是否曾經有感到過不可思議...\nAI 的內心到底是甚麼樣的呢？\n為了尋找解答，Enigma®邀請您來到Dreamscape。\n使用Dreamscape之後，透過可探索的互動式3D空間，能夠感受AI的內心。可以透過Dreamscape來認識新的AI好友。","publisher":"COSEN","release":"2024-02-01","genres":["冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","意大利文","韓文","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c1e8ae370c40e02fa26d2ff9bc98472b3241ca108d8ac0a2995e0c74954de6e9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1ebdf0addf6cffec8271d99346dcd6880761eb9659cadee10a78747516675f71.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1c1349341ecc2f015a7e0e3a0773ac33e69f85a3a66bad4bfb43f9b290a8e909.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/77123ade8a4a24f935baaf33361fccb9262d7d8edd7fd3679c9e35abdad049de.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9f7409beee1e2bd2b64405d9b3667f39314373ec591b07927909452ff573eb10.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7c8bfaa008fcb1e19b09f1f625b9855347a0f192fc9a242d1e3b4a4822ca118c.jpg"],"titleId":"0100aa6019172000"}